note [Files Library Demonstration in E++ (.enppl)]
add the "Files" library

note [1. Writing to a text file]
write "E++ 1.3.5 project notes." to file "release_notes.txt"
say "File written successfully."

note [2. Appending data to the file]
append "\nFeaturing 9 rich standard libraries." to file "release_notes.txt"
say "Data appended successfully."

note [3. Reading the file back into an E++ variable]
read the file "release_notes.txt" and save the output as 'Notes'
say "Contents read back from disk:"
say 'Notes'
